WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.701
-Guys, it is time for
"Tonight Show Hashtags."

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:04.167
Here we go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:06.033
-♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:08.434
♪♪

00:00:08.434 --> 00:00:10.434
♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:10.434 --> 00:00:12.701
♪♪

00:00:12.701 --> 00:00:14.167
-Now, we do this thing
every week,

00:00:14.167 --> 00:00:15.334
where I send out a hashtag

00:00:15.334 --> 00:00:17.334
and ask you guys to respond
to that topic.

00:00:17.334 --> 00:00:19.334
So, since a lot of schools
are on spring break,

00:00:19.334 --> 00:00:22.701
I sent out the hashtag
#SpringBreakInSixWords."

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:24.400
And I asked you
to describe your spring break

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:25.601
using only six words.

00:00:25.601 --> 00:00:27.334
Within minutes,
it was a trending topic.

00:00:27.334 --> 00:00:30.133
So thank you for playing along.
Now I thought I'd share

00:00:30.133 --> 00:00:33.534
some of my favorite responses
from you guys.

00:00:33.534 --> 00:00:36.400
This first one
is from @heartyou4evr.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.467
-Hmm.
-She says, "Shots!

00:00:38.467 --> 00:00:40.367
Don't remember much after that."

00:00:40.367 --> 00:00:43.601
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:43.601 --> 00:00:46.167
This one is from
@roadninjakelly.

00:00:46.167 --> 00:00:47.300
-Ooh.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.534
-She says, "Parents
saw me on the news."

00:00:49.534 --> 00:00:51.767
Oh, there you go. Hey
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:51.767 --> 00:00:53.400
At least they know
where you are.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.701
-Yeah.
-[ Chuckles ]

00:00:54.701 --> 00:00:57.033
This one's from @joybur10.

00:00:57.033 --> 00:01:00.334
She says, "Kiss me,
I still have antibodies."

00:01:00.334 --> 00:01:01.734
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:01.734 --> 00:01:03.934
Just got back.

00:01:03.934 --> 00:01:05.734
This one's from @K8MBrown.

00:01:05.734 --> 00:01:07.868
She says,
"Going topless this year.

00:01:07.868 --> 00:01:09.767
No mask!"
-Ah.

00:01:09.767 --> 00:01:12.667
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:12.667 --> 00:01:14.901
This one's weird.
I like it, though.

00:01:14.901 --> 00:01:18.000
It's from @Kansasbradbury.
-Oh.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.734
-He says, "Nobody
puts Baby in a cabana."

00:01:20.734 --> 00:01:24.033
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:24.033 --> 00:01:26.634
I saw that.
I don't know why I like that.

00:01:26.634 --> 00:01:28.634
"Nobody puts Baby
in the cabana."

00:01:28.634 --> 00:01:30.100
Come.
-A little "Dirty Dancing."

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:33.133
-This one's from @acnirb.
-Nirb.

00:01:33.133 --> 00:01:36.901
-He says, "What shall we
name the kid?"

00:01:36.901 --> 00:01:39.033
Oh.
-Oh, wow.

00:01:39.033 --> 00:01:41.234
Got deep fast.
[ Rim shot ]

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:44.767
-What shall we?
-What shall we name our child?

00:01:44.767 --> 00:01:46.267
-Hmm. Alright.

00:01:46.267 --> 00:01:47.701
This is "Spring Break
in Six Words."

00:01:47.701 --> 00:01:50.100
This is from @Billyclubbin.

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:51.501
-Well, he's got to have
a good one, right?

00:01:51.501 --> 00:01:52.968
He's clubbing 24/7.

00:01:52.968 --> 00:01:55.834
-You think Billyclubbin --
he's clubbing -- 24/6?

00:01:55.834 --> 00:01:57.167
-He's clubbing all the time,
yeah.

00:01:57.167 --> 00:01:59.033
24/6, takes one day off.

00:01:59.033 --> 00:02:00.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.601 --> 00:02:02.734
-Uh, you have to.
I mean, if you work that hard --

00:02:02.734 --> 00:02:04.133
you club that hard?
-Yeah. You club that hard --

00:02:04.133 --> 00:02:05.834
-You can't club that hard.
You got to take one day off.

00:02:05.834 --> 00:02:07.334
-You got to take it off
in real life.

00:02:07.334 --> 00:02:08.934
You've got to reclub yourself.
You know what I mean?

00:02:08.934 --> 00:02:10.334
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.334 --> 00:02:11.734
What time does he start
clubbing, do you think?

00:02:11.734 --> 00:02:13.601
-I would say probably, uh, noon.

00:02:13.601 --> 00:02:15.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.033 --> 00:02:17.133
-He clubs from noon --
-Till noon.

00:02:17.133 --> 00:02:19.934
-Till noon.
-Every day, for six days.

00:02:19.934 --> 00:02:21.801
-24 hours of clubbing.
-Yeah.

00:02:21.801 --> 00:02:24.501
Yep, and the one day off,
he has till noon.

00:02:24.501 --> 00:02:26.200
And then
he starts clubbing again.

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:28.033
[ Laughter ]
-It's a tough life.

00:02:28.033 --> 00:02:30.534
[ Laughter ]
But he says, uh,

00:02:30.534 --> 00:02:34.100
"Denial, anger, bargaining,
depression, acceptance, fun!"

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:36.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:36.133 --> 00:02:39.400
It's like the six stages
of spring break.

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:40.934
I love it.

00:02:40.934 --> 00:02:43.934
This is from @optimist-eeyore.

00:02:43.934 --> 00:02:46.834
She says, "Wine cheaper
than fuel, let's party!"

00:02:46.834 --> 00:02:48.534
There you go.

00:02:48.534 --> 00:02:50.734
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:50.734 --> 00:02:52.767
This last one's good.
It's from @dianebillas.

00:02:52.767 --> 00:02:55.601
She says, "We don't talk
about...spring break."

00:02:55.601 --> 00:02:56.934
There you go, everybody.

00:02:56.934 --> 00:02:58.434
Those are our
"Tonight Show Hashtags."

00:02:58.434 --> 00:02:59.968
To check out
more of our favorites,

00:02:59.968 --> 00:03:02.467
go to tonightshow.com/hashtags.

